# Manual outreach — tenants and vendors

When a landlord finishes setup (`completeOnboarding`), **no outbound SMS or email is sent automatically**. The same applies when residents or vendors are added after setup.

Managers send outreach when they are ready from **Residents** (welcome text) and **Vendors** (verification invite).

## Rule

| Event | Automatic outreach |
|---|---|
| Onboarding complete — resident with phone | **None** — send manually from Residents |
| Onboarding complete — vendor with phone/email | **None** — send manually from Vendors |
| Resident added after setup (with phone) | **None** — send manually from Residents |
| Phone added later to existing resident | **None** — send manually from Residents |
| Phone changed after setup (wrong number) | **None** — offer **Start onboarding again** on save; send only if checked |
| Vendor added after setup (with phone/email) | **None** — send manually from vendor profile |
| Find External Vendor → Invite to verify | **Manual** — explicit `sendVendorInvite` via invite modal |

## Manual send paths

| Who | Where | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Resident / tenant | Residents list or resident profile | **Start onboarding** when not started; **Retry onboarding** when waiting, delivery failed, or Action Required |
| Vendor | Vendor profile (and Find External Vendor flow) | **Send verification invite** |

## Tenant activation SMS retries

Retries apply **after** the manager sends the first welcome text (or resends).

| Attempt | When |
|---|---|
| 1 | When manager clicks Start onboarding, Retry onboarding, Send Welcome Text, or Resend Welcome Text |
| Delivery 2 | 24 hours after attempt 1 if attempt 1 failed to send |
| Delivery 3 | 72 hours after attempt 1 (final automatic delivery retry) |
| Silence follow-up | Every **48 hours** after the last welcome/nudge while `waiting` and the resident has not replied YES or NO |
| After 3 delivery failures | Stop; `activation_status = action_required`; notify landlord |
| After 14 unanswered outbound texts | Stop auto-nudge; stay `waiting` so inbound YES/NO still works; landlord can **Retry onboarding** |

**Delivery retry** only on send/carrier problems (invalid number, network/provider errors).

**Silence nudge** when the welcome was delivered (`waiting`) and the resident has not replied YES or NO — measured from `last_activation_attempt_at`, every 48 hours.

**Never auto-retry / nudge** when the resident replied STOP, YES, or NO, already opted in / activated / declined, or the phone number changed (landlord must update + **Start onboarding again** / **Retry onboarding**).

YES/START → `activated` (stop retries). NO → `declined` (stop nudges; they can still text about a repair). STOP → `opted_out` (stop retries).

If they text **anything else** while waiting (e.g. a repair), ack the message, remind them to reply YES or NO first, park the request, then run that request after they reply YES or NO.

Landlord-facing statuses: Activated · Waiting for Resident · Declined updates · Delivery Failed (Retry X of 3) · Action Required · Not started (welcome not sent yet).

Manual **Retry onboarding** / **Resend Welcome Text** restarts the retry sequence after a successful send.

Cron: `check-tenant-activation-retries`. Attempts audited in `tenant_activation_attempts`.

## Vendor verification invite silence nudges

Retries apply **after** the manager sends the first verification invite (or resends).

| Attempt | When |
|---|---|
| 1 | When manager clicks **Send verification invite** |
| Silence follow-up | Every **48 hours** after the last invite/nudge while the form is **not submitted** |
| After 14 unanswered outbound texts | Stop auto-nudge; stay invited so the vendor can still open the link; landlord can send another invite |

**Silence nudge** when the invite was delivered and the vendor has not submitted the verification form — measured from the last outbound invite/reminder, every 48 hours. Same hours and cap as tenant silence follow-ups.

**Never auto-nudge** after the form is submitted (acknowledgement SMS only), after **Override onboarding**, or when the vendor is already verified / banned.

Do **not** landlord-escalate solely because the vendor has not replied. Completing remaining verification details after submit stays optional.

Cron: `check-vendor-onboarding` / `run-workflow-escalations`. Policy: `vendorOnboardingActionDue`.

## Requirements

- Pass each vendor’s `vendorId` when sending verification so form submit updates that roster profile.
- Mint a **unique** verification link per vendor invite.
- Best-effort delivery on manual send: surface errors in the UI; log graph events for the activity feed.
- Skip people with no usable contact info (disable Send buttons when phone/email missing).
- Follow the Ulo communication writing standard for all outbound copy.
- Idempotent: skip duplicate welcome while waiting (`activation_sms_sent_at` / `waiting`) unless landlord **Retry onboarding** / **Resend Welcome Text**.

## Where it lives

- Onboarding complete (no auto-send): `src/lib/onboarding/complete.ts` → `completeOnboarding`
- Manual tenant send: `src/api/tenantActivation.ts` → `sendTenantWelcomeSms` / `resendTenantActivationSms` / `restartTenantOnboardingAfterPhoneChange`
- Manual tenant UI: `TenantActivationManualActions` in Residents + resident profile; **Start onboarding again** checkbox on `EditResidentModal` when the phone changes
- Manual vendor invite: `src/api/vendorVerification.ts` → `sendVendorInvite`; UI on `AdminVendorDetailDashboard` + `InviteVendorModal`
- Tenant send + retries: `supabase/functions/_shared/sms/tenantActivation.ts` / `send-tenant-activation` / `check-tenant-activation-retries`
- YES/NO + parked requests while waiting: `tenantMessaging.ts` / `tenantActivationPending.ts` / `tenant_activation_hold`
- Status UI: `src/lib/tenantActivationStatus.ts`

## Do not

- Auto-send welcome SMS on `completeOnboarding`, add resident, or first phone save
- Auto-send vendor verification on `completeOnboarding` or `VendorFormModal` save
- Block finishing setup on SMS/email failure (there is no automatic send at complete)
